// #69 clean whole-specification analysis fixture: ranked exception, live power,
// live derived fact, and preserved invariant across generated traces.
Fact party Identified by Alice, Bob.
Fact paid Identified by party.
Fact receipt-issued Identified by party
  Holds when paid(party).

Power issue-payment Actor party
  Holds when Not(paid(party))
  Valid when Not(paid(party))
  Creates paid(party).

Fact eligible Identified by party
  Default d_yes Holds When True
  Exception e_unpaid Overrides d_yes Rejects When Not(paid(party)).

Invariant receipt-implies-paid When
  (Forall party: Not(receipt-issued(party)) || paid(party)).
